{"id":94,"verses":[{"number":1,"arabicText":"أَلَمْ نَشْرَحْ لَكَ صَدْرَكَ","transliteration":"Alam nashrah laka sadrak","translation":"Did We not expand for you, [O Muhammad], your breast?"},{"number":2,"arabicText":"وَوَضَعْنَا عَنكَ وِزْرَكَ","transliteration":"Wa wa d'ana 'anka wizrak","translation":"And We removed from you your burden"},{"number":3,"arabicText":"ٱلَّذِىٓ أَنقَضَ ظَهْرَكَ","transliteration":"Allazee anqada zahrak","translation":"Which had weighed upon your back"},{"number":4,"arabicText":"وَرَفَعْنَا لَكَ ذِكْرَكَ","transliteration":"Wa raf 'ana laka zikrak","translation":"And raised high for you your repute."},{"number":5,"arabicText":"فَإِنَّ مَعَ ٱلْعُسْرِ يُسْرًا","transliteration":"Fa inna ma'al usri yusra","translation":"For indeed, with hardship [will be] ease."},{"number":6,"arabicText":"إِنَّ مَعَ ٱلْعُسْرِ يُسْرًۭا","transliteration":"Inna ma'al 'usri yusra","translation":"Indeed, with hardship [will be] ease."},{"number":7,"arabicText":"فَإِذَا فَرَغْتَ فَٱنصَبْ","transliteration":"Fa iza faragh ta fansab","translation":"So when you have finished [your duties], then stand up [for worship]."},{"number":8,"arabicText":"وَإِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ فَٱرْغَب","transliteration":"Wa ilaa rabbika far ghab","translation":"And to your Lord direct [your] longing."}]}